# Keep the build context small: only the Go server, the standalone geocoder
# sources, and the pinned pipeline inputs are needed.
#
# Docker evaluates these patterns with parent-directory matching (moby
# patternmatcher's MatchesOrParentMatches): a file is included only when every
# ancestor directory is also re-included. A bare `!dir/**` therefore does NOT
# re-include files under `dir` when `**` matched `dir` itself — each parent
# needs its own `!dir` line before `!dir/**`. `map-server/Dockerfile` and the
# runtime `geocoder-tool/` copies depend on this.
**
!map-server
!map-server/**
# Runtime state and local exports never belong in an image.
map-server/state/**
map-server/dist/**
!gradlew
!gradle
!gradle/**
!geocoder-tool
!geocoder-tool/build.gradle.kts
!geocoder-tool/src
!geocoder-tool/src/**
!geocoder-tool/standalone
!geocoder-tool/standalone/settings.gradle.kts
!tools
!tools/gh
!tools/gh/config.yml
!tools/gh/motorcycle.json
!tools/gh/MotoGraphImport.java
!tools/tiles
!tools/tiles/build-tiles.sh
**/build/**
**/.gradle/**
**/__pycache__/**
